{# Renders a brand as a link when its own page is reachable, and as plain text when it is not.

   `displayOnBrandOverview` gates the brand's listing page, so linking to it from a tile or a badge
   would produce a 404 - see docs/adr-log/0008-display-toggles-per-brand.md. The brand name is still
   worth showing; only the link goes away.

   A brand whose translation carries no slug has nowhere to link to, and `path()` throws on a null
   route parameter. The repository already filters those out of every listing, so this is a safety
   net for hosts that render the partial with a brand of their own.

   Parameters: `brand`, and an optional `class`. #}
{% if brand.displayOnBrandOverview and brand.slug is not empty %}
    <a href="{{ path('madcoders_sylius_brand_shop_brand_show', { slug: brand.slug }) }}"
       class="{{ class|default('') }}">{{ brand.name }}</a>
{% else %}
    <span class="{{ class|default('') }}">{{ brand.name }}</span>
{% endif %}
